<section class="brand-showcase-section">
  
  <div class="showcase-row" style="height: 500px; overflow: hidden;">
    <div class="showcase-media anim-left">
      <img src="../photos/homean1.webp" alt="Tailor working on patterns">
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-content green-poly-bg anim-up style="background-image:url('');>
      <div class="inner-text">
        <h2 class="block-title">Wuzwear Industry Customer Success Story</h2>
        <p class="block-desc">Oliver Thompson started his journey with Wuzwear Industry in 2019 with a small order of 40 pieces. With our craftsmanship and attention to detail, his collection quickly gained popularity in the UK, helping LuxeThreads stand out at local events and online marketplaces.</p>
        <p class="block-desc">From the very first order to scaling across Europe, we proudly partnered with LuxeThreads as their direct manufacturer. Today, what began as a small startup is a recognized fashion brand—and you too can begin with just 50 pieces per color and design at Wuzwear Industry.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-row row-reverse">
    <div class="showcase-media anim-right">
      <img src="../photos/homean3.jpg" alt="Apparel hanging on clothing racks">
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-content green-poly-bg anim-up">
      <div class="inner-text">
        <h2 class="block-title">The Best Custom Clothing Manufacturers In the USA for Startups</h2>
        <p class="block-desc">When it comes to custom clothing in the USA, Wuzwear Industry offers endless customization options, giving startups the freedom to bring their ideas to life with a reliable manufacturing partner. Take our custom-made t-shirts, for example—crafted with exceptional quality that stands out in the market.</p>
        <p class="block-desc">Our facilities run with efficiency and precision, ensuring every order is produced exactly as envisioned. With skilled professionals ready to assist at every step, we make the process seamless. As one of the leading custom clothing manufacturers, Wuzwear Industry ensures your needs are met with professionalism and care.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-row">
    <div class="showcase-media anim-left">
      <img src="../photos/homean4.jpg" alt="Measuring fabric close up">
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-content green-poly-bg anim-up">
      <div class="inner-text">
        <h2 class="block-title">Top Pick Among USA Clothing Manufacturers</h2>
        <p class="block-desc">If you are looking for one of the best clothing manufacturers in the USA, Wuzwear Industry is your trusted partner. Our dedicated team stays fully engaged in every step of the process, keeping you updated on the progress of your orders while ensuring flawless results. Beyond following best practices, we continuously strive for excellence. Our custom sweatshirts are a perfect example of the quality and craftsmanship we deliver.</p>
        <p class="block-desc">Recognized as a reliable American clothing manufacturer, Wuzwear Industry offers complete in-house expertise backed by modern infrastructure. From concept development and tech pack creation to detailed cut sheets and sample production, everything is handled under one roof. Once approved, your designs move to bulk manufacturing with strict quality control, ensuring you receive apparel that exceeds expectations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-row row-reverse">
    <div class="showcase-media anim-right">
      <img src="../photos/homean5.jpg" alt="Craft paper cutting on long table">
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-content green-poly-bg anim-up">
      <div class="inner-text">
        <h2 class="block-title">Dedicated High-Quality Clothing Manufacturer for Brands</h2>
        <p class="block-desc">At Wuzwear Industry, we are committed to delivering premium apparel manufacturing services with the support of a skilled team and specialized facilities. Every brand we work with receives tailored solutions that address their challenges while ensuring cost-effectiveness, smooth communication, and uncompromising quality in every piece we produce.</p>
        <p class="block-desc">We also understand that brands value accountability and consistent quality. That's why Wuzwear Industry provides reliable services across a wide range of product types and target markets. With strict ethical compliance, transparent processes, and continuous improvement practices, we make sure your custom apparel is manufactured to the highest standards. Explore our custom-made shorts and see the difference for yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="showcase-row">
    <div class="showcase-media anim-left"style="height: 500px; overflow: hidden;">
      <img src="../photos/homean6.jpg" alt="100% Cotton care label close up">
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-content green-poly-bg anim-up">
      <div class="inner-text">
        <h2 class="block-title">Custom Clothing Vendors That Cater to All Your Needs</h2>
        <p class="block-desc">Finding the right custom clothing supplier can be challenging, but Wuzwear Industry makes the process simple and stress-free. We guide you step by step, helping you bring your creative ideas to life while ensuring they fit your target market. From concept to completion, our custom printing facilities showcase the level of quality and detail we deliver.</p>
        <p class="block-desc">To create stylish and on-trend custom-made clothing, our specialists carefully evaluate every detail, from fabrics to embellishments. With our vertically integrated manufacturing process, you gain complete control and visibility at every stage. Partner with Wuzwear Industry, and you'll never need to look for another custom design clothing manufacturer again.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

<!-- faqs -->
 <section class="faq-split-section">
  <div class="faq-split-container">
    
    <div class="faq-left-col">
      <h2 class="faq-main-title">FAQS</h2>
      
      <div class="faq-accordion">
        <details class="faq-item" open>
          <summary class="faq-trigger">
            What is the minimum order quantity for your clothing manufacturing services?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) depends on the type of product and customization required. Please contact us for detailed MOQ information.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-trigger">
            What types of payment do you accept?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>We accept a variety of secure payment methods including major credit cards, bank wire transfers, and digital payment platforms. Detailed processing instructions will be supplied with your order invoice.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-trigger">
            How can I place a repeat order?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>Placing a repeat order is simple. You can log into your account dashboard to re-submit a prior project run, or contact your dedicated account agent directly to re-verify your patterns and bulk counts.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-trigger">
            How do I track the status of my order?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>Once tracking information is generated by production teams, you will receive an automatic email dispatch containing transit links. Real-time updates are also viewable inside your active account portal.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-trigger">
            What are your business hours?
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-content">
            <p>Our operations desk and manufacturing facilities run Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM. Digital support channels remain available for immediate assistance responses.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-right-col">
      <img src="../photos/homean7.jpg" alt="Person thinking over options and customer inquiries">
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
